{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu18", "cards": [{"id": "u1.t.binomial-nomenclature", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">NO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">mi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">al<\/span> <span class=\"st\">NO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">men<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cla<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ture<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"binomial nomenclature\" data-audio=\"audio/binomial-nomenclature.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: binomial nomenclature\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"binomial nomenclature\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Homo sapiens<\/text><text x=\"60\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">genus (capital)<\/text><text x=\"145\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species (lowercase)<\/text><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"76.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"63.0\"/><polygon points=\"60.0,63.0 62.2,67.5 57.8,67.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"145.0\" y1=\"76.0\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"63.0\"/><polygon points=\"145.0,63.0 147.2,67.5 142.8,67.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">written in italics<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A naming system where each species gets a two-part Latin name: genus then species.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>双名法<\/b>：每个物种用两部分拉丁名：先属名，后种加词。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bi- = two, nomen = name. Two names. Genus is Capitalized, species is lowercase.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">bi- = 二，nomen = 名：两个名字；属名首字母大写，种加词小写。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Write the scientific name of humans.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Homo sapiens (genus Homo, species sapiens).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.genus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">nus<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"genus\" data-audio=\"audio/genus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: genus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"genus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"24\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"34\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"34\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"24\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"11\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">genus Panthera<\/text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"36\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Panthera leo<\/text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"36\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Panthera tigris<\/text><text x=\"50\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lion<\/text><text x=\"150\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tiger<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A group of closely related species. The first part of a scientific name.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>属<\/b>：由亲缘关系很近的物种组成的类群，也是学名的前半部分。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Genus = &quot;same family name&quot;: lion and tiger are both Panthera.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">genus 像「姓」：狮子和老虎都姓 Panthera。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Lion is Panthera leo and tiger is Panthera tigris. What do they share?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The same genus, Panthera.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.species", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">SPE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cies<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"species\" data-audio=\"audio/species.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: species\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"species\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Two<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">members<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">of a<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mate<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fertile<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">offspring<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A group of organisms that can breed with each other and produce fertile offspring.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>物种<\/b>：能够相互交配并产生可育后代的一群生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Species is the same word for one and many: one species, two species.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">species 单复数同形。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: A horse and a donkey have a mule that cannot reproduce. Are they one species?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. The offspring is not fertile, so they are separate species.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.domain", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">MAIN<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"domain\" data-audio=\"audio/domain.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: domain\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"domain\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"192\" height=\"112\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Domain (broadest)<\/text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"18\" width=\"172\" height=\"84\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Kingdom<\/text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"32\" width=\"152\" height=\"56\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Phylum<\/text><rect x=\"34\" y=\"46\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Class<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The broadest group in classification, above kingdom.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>域<\/b>：分类中最大的一级，高于界。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Domain = the biggest &quot;territory&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">domain = 最大的「领地」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which is bigger: domain or kingdom?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Domain.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.kingdom", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">KING<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">dom<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"kingdom\" data-audio=\"audio/kingdom.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: kingdom\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"kingdom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Domain<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eukarya<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Kingdom<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Animalia<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Phylum<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Chordata<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A large group of organisms, the rank just below domain.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>界<\/b>：域之下的大类群。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Kingdom = a big realm, like animals or plants.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">界 = 大王国，如动物界、植物界。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which kingdom do humans belong to?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Animalia (animals).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.phylum", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PHY<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lum<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"phylum\" data-audio=\"audio/phylum.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: phylum\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phylum\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Kingdom<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Animalia<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Phylum<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Chordata<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Class<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mammalia<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A rank below kingdom. Animals in one phylum share a basic body plan.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>门<\/b>：界之下的一级，同一门的动物有相似的基本身体结构。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phylum = &quot;tribe&quot;. Plural: phyla. Chordata = animals with a nerve cord.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">phylum 复数 phyla；脊索动物门 Chordata。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is the plural of phylum?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Phyla.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.class", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CLASS<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"class\" data-audio=\"audio/class.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: class\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"class\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Phylum<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Chordata<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Class<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mammalia<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Order<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Primates<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A rank below phylum. Mammals are one class.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>纲<\/b>：门之下的一级，例如哺乳纲。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Class sits between phylum and order.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">class 在门和目之间。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which class are humans in?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Mammalia (mammals).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.order", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">OR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">der<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"order\" data-audio=\"audio/order.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: order\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"order\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Class<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mammalia<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Order<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Primates<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Family<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Hominidae<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A rank below class. Primates are one order.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>目<\/b>：纲之下的一级，例如灵长目。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Order sits between class and family.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">order 在纲和科之间。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which order includes monkeys, apes and humans?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Primates.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u1.t.binomial-nomenclature", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A naming system where each species gets a two-part Latin name: genus then species.”<\/i>", "opts": ["class", "multicellular", "binomial nomenclature", "family"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>binomial nomenclature<\/b>: A naming system where each species gets a two-part Latin name: genus then species. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">双名法<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.genus", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A group of closely related species. The first part of a scientific name.”<\/i>", "opts": ["levels of organization", "response", "genus", "community"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>genus<\/b>: A group of closely related species. The first part of a scientific name. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">属<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.species", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A group of organisms that can breed with each other and produce fertile offspring.”<\/i>", "opts": ["phylum", "autotroph", "Archaea", "species"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>species<\/b>: A group of organisms that can breed with each other and produce fertile offspring. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物种<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.domain", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The broadest group in classification, above kingdom.”<\/i>", "opts": ["species", "domain", "phylum", "cell"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>domain<\/b>: The broadest group in classification, above kingdom. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">域<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.kingdom", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A large group of organisms, the rank just below domain.”<\/i>", "opts": ["reproduction", "organ system", "kingdom", "common ancestor"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>kingdom<\/b>: A large group of organisms, the rank just below domain. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">界<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.phylum", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A rank below kingdom. Animals in one phylum share a basic body plan.”<\/i>", "opts": ["reproduction", "phylum", "derived characteristic", "cladogram"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>phylum<\/b>: A rank below kingdom. Animals in one phylum share a basic body plan. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">门<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.class", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A rank below phylum. Mammals are one class.”<\/i>", "opts": ["order", "binomial nomenclature", "class", "prokaryote"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>class<\/b>: A rank below phylum. Mammals are one class. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纲<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.order", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A rank below class. Primates are one order.”<\/i>", "opts": ["response", "unicellular", "order", "Archaea"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>order<\/b>: A rank below class. Primates are one order. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">目<\/span>", "whys": null}]}